sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to send a TxDefaultProfile charging profile<br>with a maxOfflineDuration and invalidAfterOfflineDuration set to true

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest (chargingProfilePurpose = TxDefaultProfile, maxOfflineDuration, invalidAfterOfflineDuration = true)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: chargingProfile.chargingProfilePurpose must be TxDefaultProfile<br>chargingProfile.maxOfflineDuration must be not omitted<br>chargingProfile.invalidAfterOfflineDuration must be true

    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
